  "description": "With vintage flair on the outside, modern convenience on the inside, and electronic excitement all around, Beaumont Rev 3’s new and improved design is ready for your everyday urban adventures. This city ebike has been upgraded with a customized complete Ananda E-System, Tektro mechanical disc brakes with added vibration resistance, and a fully integrated headlight and bell for enhanced safety. This ebike offers 5 levels of pedal assist, full throttle up to 20 mph, and a mid-mounted battery delivering up to 42 miles of balanced, efficient range. Every morning commute and weekend errand run is now easy, comfortable, and fun thanks to this ebike’s accessible step through steel frame, ergonomic padded saddle, high-volume tires and included rear rack & fenders. Beaumont Rev 3 is perfectly suited for city riding, and every kind of urbanite will agree that with this ebike, the journey is the destination.",
